 in September 2026, and how to define the moment a company becomes aware of an exploited flaw. He also covers what CISOs should ask suppliers, and how … More → The post The Cyber Resilience Act clock doesn’t stop for weekends appeared first on Help Net Security .</description><chr2:heatScore>45.0</chr2:heatScore></item></channel></rss>